OL,3,ATrump hits out at US central bank's
OL,4,Adecision to hike interest rates
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US central bank raises interest
OL,7,Frates for the first time in three years
OL,8,Ffrom 3.5%-3.75% to 3.75%-4%
OL,10,F"The plain fact is inflation is too
OL,11,Fhigh, and has been for too long," Fed
OL,12,Fchairman Kevin Warsh says - a remark
OL,13,Fthat neatly summarises the rationale
OL,14,Fbehind today's rise, writes our
OL,15,Fbusiness correspondent
OL,17,F"Unfortunate" is how a White House
OL,18,Fspokesman describes the increase, while
OL,19,FDemocrats blame Trump
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
