OL,3,ATrump hits out at US central bank's
OL,4,Adecision to hike interest rates
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Fed has been seeking to curb rising
OL,7,Fprices as the Iran war pushes up global
OL,8,Foil prices, which have hit American
OL,9,Fconsumers
OL,11,FWhat are interest rates? They set the
OL,12,Fcost of borrowing money, and influence
OL,13,Fmortgages, loans and savings but can
OL,14,Falso boost returns on savings. Central
OL,15,Fbanks often hike up rates when they
OL,16,Fthink inflation is too high
